note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Private graph state owns all candidates and canonical bytes. Not a qualification authority.
note Qualification records must be resolved by existing evaluator/receipt owners, not the caller.
note One selection under existing session lock; copy only selected canonical record from immutable graph pool.
fn native_graph q view ulong 64 rows view ulong 1024 p edit ulong 528 want view uchar 4096 records view uchar 65536 out edit ulong 32 to long
sel = new ulong 16 0
real = new uchar 4096 0
for i ulong 32
put out i 0
end
rc = pl_select q rows sel
if ne rc 0
ret long rc
end
if ge get sel 1 16
ret 65
end
base = mul get sel 1 4096
for i ulong 4096
put real i get records add base i
end
rc = pl_checkrow rows want real sel
if ne rc 0
ret long rc
end
ret long pl_finish q rows p sel out
end
